# Optional settings for `docker compose` (copy to .env; it is not committed). The model providers
# are configured in lang-reader.toml, not here (README, "Connect a model"). With ./run.sh export
# a variable in your shell instead. Every name below is documented in the README settings table.

# Unread lessons to keep ready (1-10).
# ARC_LANG_QUEUE_TARGET=3

# Turn the generation worker off and import lessons by hand.
# ARC_LANG_AUTO_GENERATE=0

# Extra language-pack directories (comma separated), for private packs.
# ARC_LANG_PACK_DIRS=/packs

# A password for the web interface (see "Access and exposure" in the README).
# ARC_LANG_AUTH=password
# ARC_LANG_AUTH_PASSWORD_HASH=
# ARC_LANG_ALLOWED_HOSTS=reader.example.com
